gVisor (nvproxy)
https://github.com/google/gvisor
Copyright The gVisor Authors.
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE-APACHE-2.0).

The ABI crate in gen/ is ported from and generated out of gVisor's
pkg/abi/nvgpu and pkg/sentry/devices/nvproxy:

  gen/src/lib.rs, gen/src/types.rs, gen/src/version.rs
      ported from pkg/abi/nvgpu and pkg/sentry/devices/nvproxy/version.go;
  gen/src/versions/v*.rs
      generated by gen/nvabi_gen.py (with gen/nvabi_sizes.py) from nvproxy's
      per-release handler tables and pkg/abi/nvgpu's struct declarations;
  device/src/nvidia.rs, device/src/handle_table.rs
      the escape handling those tables drive follows nvproxy's (each place
      says which part).

gen/rmallow_extract.py reads nvproxy's allowed control and class lists as a
hint when it classifies what a workload needs; no list is copied from them.

