Struct layouts, ioctl and control numbers, class numbers and parameter sizes
throughout device/, driver/ and gen/ are taken from these sources. The
following are extracted from each supported release's sources by the
scripts in gen/ (gen/README.md):

  gen/rmctrl/*.json, gen/src/rmctrl/generated.rs, driver/gen/nvgpu_rm_deep.h
      (gen/rmctrl_extract.py: the pointers RM follows inside controls);
  gen/rmallow/*.json, gen/src/rmallow/generated.rs
      (gen/rmallow_extract.py: the RM allowlist);
  gen/nvkms/*.json (gen/nvkms_extract.py: NVKMS and nvidia-drm layouts);
  gen/uvm/*.json (gen/uvm_extract.py: UVM parameter block sizes);
  gen/schema/*.py, gen/src/schema/generated.rs, driver/gen/nvgpu_schema.h
      (gen/schema_gen.py: the IOCTL2 schema, from the tables above and the
      Linux DRM uapi headers drm.h and drm_mode.h, which are MIT-licensed);
  driver/gen/nvgpu_rmalloc_classes.h, driver/gen/nvgpu_v1v2_rewrites.h
      (gen/nvgpu_gen.py, from driver 595.58.03).

